# Snippet projects that are not canonically formatted yet.
#
# scripts/check-book-format.sh reports these without failing. Everything not
# listed here is gated: a new snippet, or an edit to an already-canonical one,
# must be `bynkc fmt` clean under the project's own `[fmt]` settings.
#
# No project is baselined. Chapters 5 and 8, the last two, were reformatted
# in October 2026, with their `source-lines` ranges re-derived.
#
# This is a ratchet. A project here that has become canonical fails the gate with
# a note to delete its line, so the list can only shrink and cannot go stale.
#
# One project path per line, relative to snippets/.
